WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.960
This video covers getting
audio in on iPhone,

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.350
and what to do when
something interrupts it.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.430
Tap Record and choose your patient.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.950
To use audio you already
have, tap Choose From Phone.

00:00:11.335 --> 00:00:13.895
An incoming call can
interrupt a recording,

00:00:13.895 --> 00:00:16.215
so noctune reminds you to silence calls.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.965
Tap How for the steps.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.310
Tap Start Recording.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:24.790
Hold Pause when you step out, then
tap Resume recording to continue.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.680
If a call does interrupt,
the take pauses, and the

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:30.070
app tries to resume it when the call ends.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.390
When you're done, hold
Finish and transcribe.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.930
The recording uploads while
you keep using the app.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.180
It's saved on this device
until the upload is

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.170
done, so it's safe to leave this screen.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.400
If a recording can't finish
uploading, for example because

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.350
the app closed first,
it stays on your iPhone.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.190
Next time you open noctune,
Today shows On-device recordings.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.070
Tap Upload, then Upload now.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.510
You can also save a copy, or
discard a recording you don't need.
